This package adapts TSA complaint-count data standardized by the Data Liberation
Project and volunteers: https://github.com/data-liberation-project/tsa-complaint-counts
Frozen source revision: e9f8b5e89b4774eb97b93165ee96b4bc986d4319.
Changes: aggregation, reliability summaries, percentage-point airport profiles,
and original chart designs. No raw complaint files are redistributed.

The internal airport audit uses IATA/ICAO List data available from
https://github.com/ip2location/ip2location-iata-icao under CC BY-SA 4.0.
No lookup rows or geographic coordinates are redistributed.
IATA and ICAO are trademarks of their respective owners; no endorsement implied.
